From ua236d3d356ca53fd at groups.google.com  Sat Jan  2 17:06:59 2016
From: ua236d3d356ca53fd at groups.google.com (Aki Vehtari)
Date: Sat, 02 Jan 2016 17:06:59 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] new density notation
Message-ID: <JWgsqcVvHto.yFaitBojDgAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <JWgsqcVvHto.ZyIZ9jfgDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <JWgsqcVvHto.O0EbA3lKDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <JWgsqcVvHto.ZyIZ9jfgDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
