> On Jan 2, 2016, at 11:13 AM, Krzysztof Sakrejda <krzysztof...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> I tried searching the list for the background about the vertical bar/pipe discussion but it's not coming up, sorry if this covers well-trod ground.
