References: <325D3xsaI08.RYSyM5u1CgAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <325D3xsaI08.zHlMZ_QHCwAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/325D3xsaI08/m/8N-1mRAJCwAJ>
