Nobody's minor --- please jump in if you have something to say.

Are you agreeing with Andrew, normal_lp() for log pdf/pmf and
normal_cdf_lp() for log CDF?

That's back to where we started with "lp" in place of "log",
which just feels more obscure.  But the argument against "log"
for those keeping score is that it conflicts with the
link function for Poisson and nobody likes poisson_log_log().
And I think we've prett much tabled the <link=log> business
because we think users will overgeneralize.

- Bob

