From uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com  Fri Jan 29 02:53:07 2016
From: uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com (Andrew Gelman)
Date: Fri, 29 Jan 2016 02:53:07 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] cleaner notation!
Message-ID: <GxmQL_wxtSo.DzP85vvwDAAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
