Subject: Re: [stan-dev] cleaner notation!
Message-ID: <GxmQL_wxtSo.ABBO94kSDQAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <GxmQL_wxtSo.icvuR8rwDAAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <GxmQL_wxtSo.qK2lsvVHDAAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <GxmQL_wxtSo.icvuR8rwDAAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
