> > > >>>>>>>>> lp += cauchy_lpdf(sigma | 0, 2.5);
> > > >>>>>>>>> lp += normal_lpdf(y | alpha * x + beta, sigma);
> > > >>>>>>>>> }
> > > >>>>>>>>>
> > > >>>>>>>>> may or may not make it aesthetically better and as Bob pointed
> > out: "On the specific point of lp vs. target, I don't think it matters
